{"title": "Knowledge of the Ages: Dexterity", "pageid": 30083, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Knowledge_of_the_Ages:_Dexterity", "categories": ["Class actions", "Actions", "Channel Divinity actions"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Knowledge_of_the_Ages.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/1b/Knowledge_of_the_Ages.webp/300px-Knowledge_of_the_Ages.webp, /w/images/1/1b/Knowledge_of_the_Ages.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/1b/Knowledge_of_the_Ages.webp/300px-Knowledge_of_the_Ages.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/1b/Knowledge_of_the_Ages.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure><b>Knowledge of the Ages</b> is a <a href=\"/wiki/Channel_Divinity_Charge\" title=\"Channel Divinity Charge\">Channel Divinity</a> action available to <a href=\"/wiki/Knowledge_Domain\" title=\"Knowledge Domain\">Knowledge Domain</a> clerics. It allows these clerics to channel divine power, gaining <a href=\"/wiki/Proficiency\" title=\"Proficiency\">proficiency</a> in all <a href=\"/wiki/Skills\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Skills\">skills</a> based on <a href=\"/wiki/Dexterity\" title=\"Dexterity\">Dexterity</a>.\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\nGain <a href=\"/wiki/Proficiency\" title=\"Proficiency\">Proficiency</a> in <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Acrobatics\" title=\"Acrobatics\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/57/Acrobatics_Icon.png/25px-Acrobatics_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/57/Acrobatics_Icon.png/38px-Acrobatics_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/57/Acrobatics_Icon.png/50px-Acrobatics_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Acrobatics\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/57/Acrobatics_Icon.png/25px-Acrobatics_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/57/Acrobatics_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Acrobatics\" title=\"Acrobatics\">Acrobatics</a>, <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Sleight_of_Hand\" title=\"Sleight of Hand\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/46/Sleight_of_Hand_Icon.png/25px-Sleight_of_Hand_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/46/Sleight_of_Hand_Icon.png/38px-Sleight_of_Hand_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/4/46/Sleight_of_Hand_Icon.png/50px-Sleight_of_Hand_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Sleight of Hand\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/46/Sleight_of_Hand_Icon.png/25px-Sleight_of_Hand_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/46/Sleight_of_Hand_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Sleight_of_Hand\" title=\"Sleight of Hand\">Sleight of Hand</a>, and <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Stealth\" title=\"Stealth\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b9/Stealth_Icon.png/25px-Stealth_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b9/Stealth_Icon.png/38px-Stealth_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b9/Stealth_Icon.png/50px-Stealth_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Stealth\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b9/Stealth_Icon.png/25px-Stealth_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/