 nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Knowledge_of_the_Ages\" title=\"Knowledge of the Ages\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b9/Knowledge_of_the_Ages_Icon.webp/40px-Knowledge_of_the_Ages_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b9/Knowledge_of_the_Ages_Icon.webp/60px-Knowledge_of_the_Ages_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b9/Knowledge_of_the_Ages_Icon.webp/80px-Knowledge_of_the_Ages_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Knowledge of the Ages\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b9/Knowledge_of_the_Ages_Icon.webp/40px-Knowledge_of_the_Ages_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b9/Knowledge_of_the_Ages_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Knowledge_of_the_Ages\" title=\"Knowledge of the Ages\">Knowledge of the Ages</a></span>\n</p>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>This action does not stack with other versions of Knowledge of the Ages. Only one type can be active at once and recasting the ability will remove the old effect.</li></ul>\n</div>   \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260715043209\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.076 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.081 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 2948/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 41950/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 16639/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 25/200\nExpensive parser function count: 3/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 35/1000\nLua time usage: 0.015/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1254811/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n115.81%   78.405     34 Template:Trim\n100.00%   67.699      1 Template:Feature_page\n100.00%   67.699      1